1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.040 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
So, you know what?

2
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.640 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
We started with...

3
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.740 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
“I am virtue in the form of humility.

4
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.220 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I no longer want to be important.

5
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.320 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I don’t seek to be more important.

6
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.460 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I control my pride.”

7
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
“Vanity no longer rules me.

8
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.600 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Arrogance isn’t part of me,

9
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
because I control my pride.”

10
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.570 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Today, thank God, I understand better

11
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.130 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
why I’m here.

12
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:38.450 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I was very prideful in the past.
Very prideful in some of my actions...

13
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:43.030 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Very prideful. Pride was part
of my life. Wow,

14
00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:49.030 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
all the time. Pride brought me no good.
Nothing. When we started

15
00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.730 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
