I didn’t even want to take part.

16
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.970 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I’ll be honest with you.

17
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.030 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
“I’m not going. That’s for crazy people.”

18
00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.870 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Humility. When it came up, I thought:
my God... I was

19
00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:05.530 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
far too curious, wanting to try too much.
I did it just to have something

20
00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:11.530 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
to show other people. Rage ruled me.
I’d lose it.

21
00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:15.910 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I wanted all the control.
So many factors: status,

22
00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.550 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
not accepting so many things,
past traumas,

23
00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:28.050 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
not accepting the father I had,
or my mother... You know? A

24
00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:33.450 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
relationship that hurt me deeply long ago,
but still affects me

25
00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.630 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
today. Thinking of it hurts, you know?

26
00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:39.730 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Then I need a better thought about it,
so it doesn’t happen.

27
00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:42.010 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
A sense of belonging, right?

28
00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:47.970 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Belonging to a group, a social class...
All of that drew so much attention.

29
00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:51.310 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Pride. At the center of it all
is pride.

30
00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:55.530 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I know these virtues shake
our entire structure,

31
00:01:55.770 --> 00:02:00.570 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
because they do. For me, I think
forgiveness was one of the

32
00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:06.190 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
hardest. Forgiving someone
who hurt you

33
00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.570 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
deeply, who did...

34
00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.470 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
When you remember, it comes back.
I think it hurts a lot.

35
00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.630 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
