40
00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:33.420 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
First, I need to forgive myself.

41
00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
But who are we to forgive anyone?

42
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.240 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I’m trying to ask myself:
who am I to forgive someone?

43
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.550 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I make so many mistakes. I have before,
and I’ll keep making them...

44
00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:46.800 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
And with that, I lost the chance to...

45
00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.200 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
[Do you feel guilty in some way?]

46
00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:58.870 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Who am I not to forgive?

47
00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.990 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Before that person hurt me,
or other things hurt me, I’d hurt so many

48
00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.910 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
