60
00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.690 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Now, thank God, I do.

61
00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.130 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I have to accept it.

62
00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.710 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Accept that I’m deprived of liberty

63
00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.520 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
and there’s nothing to do.

64
00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.870 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
All my options used up?
Can I do anything?

65
00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.710 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
A lawyer? Yes. Can they act? Yes.

66
00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.180 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
All used up? Nothing I can do.
So I must accept it.

67
00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:09.850 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
In our battle against pride,
it creates many parts of this

68
00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:15.610 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
army that mentally wears a person down,
until they reach a point

69
00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:18.910 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
