my own awareness.

81
00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:02.810 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
This course helps you gain,
regain awareness.

82
00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.490 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
I’m seeking improvement.
I’m seeking change.

83
00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.590 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
The first thing I do
