84
00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:12.930 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Every day. Every day,
I listen to the humility song.

85
00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.770 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
It’s made a difference in my life.

86
00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:19.850 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
Things happen in our lives all the time.
But what do we have to

87
00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:20.650 line:8% position:50% align:center size:90%
